{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many see only chaos in the frontier peninsula of Briaria, you see opportunity. Guilds of Greybrook is a roguelike management simulator where your choices matter. You choose who to hire, which contracts to take on, and which of the territory's squabbling factions to team up with, if any.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you try the demo? Fill out the official feedback form on our website!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative roguelike management gameplay inspired by tabletop experiences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom dice that you can upgrade and improve.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events keep every run feeling different!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions that will affect the fate of the peninsula!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712780/extras/602ffbb67f8ecf998bf3dc10804fe6d1.poster.avif?t=1772146890\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712780/extras/602ffbb67f8ecf998bf3dc10804fe6d1.webm?t=1772146890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712780/extras/602ffbb67f8ecf998bf3dc10804fe6d1.mp4?t=1772146890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Mercenaries&quot; is such a dirty word, you prefer &quot;adventurers!&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the choppy waters of business management, you've got employees to pay and taxes due so make sure to manage your finances carefully, or perhaps find a sneaky way out of paying either altogether.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712780/extras/bccce180f3429e820e3113bc6b1dc384.poster.avif?t=1772146890\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712780/extras/bccce180f3429e820e3113bc6b1dc384.webm?t=1772146890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712780/extras/bccce180f3429e820e3113bc6b1dc384.mp4?t=1772146890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Literally &quot;roll the dice&quot; to keep your business afloat.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each job you take requires you meet a different stat threshold. Using a discerning eye, assign the right members for the job and roll the dice (cross your fingers they don't mess it up, or worse, get injured.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712780/extras/0d23a6c9a9852f2f8b4adbfca7c92798.poster.avif?t=1772146890\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712780/extras/0d23a6c9a9852f2f8b4adbfca7c92798.webm?t=1772146890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712780/extras/0d23a6c9a9852f2f8b4adbfca7c92798.mp4?t=1772146890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble the strongest guild the peninsula has ever seen!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons turn though the jobs will keep getting harder, make sure your employees aren't falling behind. Send members on training days, equip them with useful items from the local shops, or maybe just replace them with someone more competent (I'm sure they won't be vindictive about it.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to put your stamp on the face of history and wishlist Guilds of Greybrook today!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Season's End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/7035e2a0cee2a6f2ec98c5f98e8f627161ba03ed.jpg"},{"name":"Tax Cheat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/14b9cd3efb28fccaa16437cde8c258d88e2dad5c.jpg"},{"name":"Heavens Blessed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/dd5b4c948fe7dd0abbd6ba09da9957721647b119.jpg"},{"name":"Revolutionary Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/59f7970d5c070a1cda108047478dacf0bde1d0b6.jpg"},{"name":"True Neutral","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/36dda47e0153114c028d0bab5bc3cbe235cf918f.jpg"},{"name":"Guy's Benefactor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/d21e5fae7165511d64a191152eeb334b2a3c9294.jpg"},{"name":"Educated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/a2105463bb4f9f83cc3a64f0d32c4ff11457e50a.jpg"},{"name":"Huge Success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/2ada26ac8d8c630998743590ee806e55f2f50c0d.jpg"},{"name":"Cheapskate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/85afbd057f5e7e4f52da73cbdb585fc026952d5e.jpg"},{"name":"Clocked Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3712780/26b04b0945b12bb87cd55b0087e0a92968ce5071.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712780?t=1772146890","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712780?t=1772146890",